160
00:14:11,455 --> 00:14:14,709
Then raise the Coulomb friction to 0.3,

161
00:14:14,729 --> 00:14:21,090
work out the largest steady error as the friction torque over the product of

162
00:14:21,110 --> 00:14:22,265
the two gains,

163
