170
00:14:54,332 --> 00:15:00,148
First find three moments on the upper plot: the notch in the current,

171
00:15:00,168 --> 00:15:05,223
the force overtaking the spring, and the armature bottoming.

172
00:15:05,623 --> 00:15:11,514
